md2card-skill

This repository is an independent, original implementation of a Markdown
knowledge-card workflow and renderer. General product inspiration:

- https://mdcard.cn/
- https://github.com/agnostic-ap/md2card

It is not a fork of either project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
those projects or their maintainers. No source code, CSS, templates, artwork,
logos, or product copy from those projects is included.

The MIT license in LICENSE covers the original repository contents. It does
not relicense third-party dependencies, user-supplied content, linked materials,
fonts installed on a user's system, or any trademarks. Third-party dependencies
retain their own licenses; consult their installed packages and lockfile.

No font files or AGPL-licensed source from the inspiration projects are bundled.
The font-family stacks name optional local system fonts only.
